the agenda forward. So just completely echoing and&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:24:30.800 --> 02:24:33.360
agreeing with you on that point.
&gt;&gt;David Prior: Mike?&nbsp;

02:24:36.720 --> 02:24:39.120
&gt;&gt;Mike Coupe: I feel like I&nbsp;
should at least respond to Wol’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:24:40.319 --> 02:24:46.639
